    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Notice how you address the person serving, cleaning, delivering, or waiting beside you. Simple respect can interrupt the ranking of people by status and convenience.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
