    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "After something goes wrong, identify what needs care and what can be learned. A small return to responsibility may be wiser than making a dramatic promise.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
