    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Build one small support habit before a crisis arrives. A regular check-in or shared task can make asking for help more natural when a difficult day comes.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
