    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "If preparation has become another delay, choose a small first action. You can learn from beginning without committing to a large or irreversible decision before you are ready.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
    ReadingCard("hope",
