    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Return to one sentence from today's verse during an ordinary task. You can give it room to settle before deciding what action it invites.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
