    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "You can ask for the Spirit's help before a difficult choice today. You do not have to supply every ounce of patience or insight alone.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
