    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Pause after one helpful moment today. You can name what you received, thank God, and tell the person involved that their care made a difference.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
    ReadingCard("hope",
        "You can make room to notice goodness after a pressing need changes. The man who returned to Jesus refused to let gratitude disappear into the next demand.\n\nLet this be a steady reminder rather than another demand to perform well. Remembering God's care can make space for a more patient response to yourself and to others. Today's limits are real, and there can still be something faithful and good within them."),
    ReadingCard("prayer",
