    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Consider a resource you could lend, share, or use to help someone today. Generosity may begin with access and attention as much as with money.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
