    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Choose a short prayer or a familiar hymn for a hard moment today. It can help you stay oriented toward God while practical questions remain unresolved.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
