    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Replace one sweeping accusation against yourself with a specific truth today. You can name what happened, seek forgiveness, and choose one practical act of repair.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
