    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "On an uneven day, return to a simple act of trust. You can take correction seriously while remembering that God's faithful character is not as changeable as your mood.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
