    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Ask someone what would lighten their load, rather than assuming you know. You can also name one place where you would benefit from receiving support.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
