    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Name one truth that has helped steady you recently. You can give thanks for it and return to it when the day's demands begin pulling your attention apart.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
    ReadingCard("hope",
