    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Think of one person whose effort has gone mostly unnoticed. Offer a specific, honest word today that tells them what you value in the way they live.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
