    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Choose one small spiritual practice you can actually sustain today. You can care for your body and make room for your inner life without turning either into competition.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
