    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Choose one area of life where you can act with care today. A consistent, honest response may communicate more clearly than trying to prove that you deserve attention.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
    ReadingCard("hope",
