    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Instead of waiting for stronger feelings, take one faithful step today. You can pray plainly, seek wise company, or do the good thing already in front of you.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
