        "Think about what makes you feel restored in someone's company. Offer a small version of that care today, while keeping your own need for rest in view.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
    ReadingCard("hope",
