    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "The reasons you trust God's character can steady you today. An uncertain moment need not become a final verdict on God's care or your whole future.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
