    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Before deciding today, name what you do not know. You can ask for wisdom clearly rather than rushing to sound confident or borrowing certainty you do not have.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
