    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Name one good thing you received today and who helped bring it. You can thank both God and that person without needing the entire day to be easy.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
