    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Before accepting advice today, examine its tone and likely fruit. You can seek another perspective when certainty is loud but gentleness, fairness, or honesty seems absent.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
