    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Choose a safe person when something needs bringing into the light. You can ask for prayer and appropriate practical help without sharing more than you are ready to share.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
