    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "Ask for help with one area where you feel vulnerable today. You can use wise supports while letting trust soften the pressure to become completely self-sufficient.\n\nYou may find that this becomes clearer through practice rather than through a sudden feeling. Let one interaction today be shaped by patience and attention. If the day is difficult, begin again gently; a hard moment does not erase the possibility of a faithful next step."),
