    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "You can let yourself grieve and seek comfort today without deciding that hope requires cheerfulness. A quiet prayer can hold sorrow and expectation in the same breath.\n\nThere is room for an ordinary beginning. A sincere conversation, an offer of help, or a decision to pause before responding can express faith in everyday life. You do not need to solve the whole situation before doing the next loving and responsible thing."),
