    ReadingCard("encouragement",
        "As this year's readings draw toward their close, remember one truth that has given you light. You can carry it into the ordinary choices still ahead.\n\nBring this truth into the next part of your routine. It might meet you while preparing a meal, waiting for a message, or finishing a demanding task. A small response made with care can matter even when no one else sees it."),
